==============================================================================
3. Rust crates compiled into wol-manager.exe and wolm.exe
==============================================================================

The following Rust crates (target x86_64-pc-windows-msvc, normal dependencies
only, including the procedural macros used to compile them) are compiled into
the programs. Each crate is listed with the license expression it declares.
Where a crate offers a choice of licenses, WoL Manager uses it under the
license in whose section it is listed further below.

The Slint crates (slint, slint-macros, i-slint-*) are used under the Slint
Royalty-free Desktop, Mobile, and Web Applications License 2.0
(LicenseRef-Slint-Royalty-free-2.0); its full text is in section 2 above.

